{"signature": "{\"text\": \"In practical questions, a device takes in energy and transfers it into useful and less useful forms. Less useful energy is often described as wasted or dissipated. It has not been destroyed. It has been spread into surrounding internal energy stores, making it harder to use for the intended purpose. If we account for every transfer, the total energy input equals the total energy output.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 28.551837, "words": [["In", 0.0], ["practical", 0.197], ["questions,", 0.755], ["a", 1.521], ["device", 1.707], ["takes", 2.148], ["in", 2.659], ["energy", 2.926], ["and", 3.541], ["transfers", 3.762], ["it", 4.423], ["into", 4.702], ["useful", 5.143], ["and", 5.596], ["less", 5.793], ["useful", 6.049], ["forms.", 6.478], ["Less", 7.535], ["useful", 7.86], ["energy", 8.313], ["is", 8.812], ["often", 9.067], ["described", 9.474], ["as", 10.252], ["wasted", 10.6], ["or", 11.25], ["dissipated.", 11.54], ["It", 12.829], ["has", 13.038], ["not", 13.224], ["been", 13.41], ["destroyed.", 13.618], ["It", 14.466], ["has", 14.71], ["been", 14.919], ["spread", 15.128], ["into", 15.604], ["surrounding", 15.964], ["internal", 16.579], ["energy", 17.159], ["stores,", 17.647], ["making", 18.46], ["it", 18.866], ["harder", 19.04], ["to", 19.563], ["use", 19.783], ["for", 20.12], ["the", 20.317], ["intended", 20.468], ["purpose.", 21.049], ["If", 21.769], ["we", 21.978], ["account", 22.152], ["for", 22.604], ["every", 22.86], ["transfer,", 23.22], ["the", 24.114], ["total", 24.311], ["energy", 24.799], ["input", 25.321], ["equals", 25.878], ["the", 26.575], ["total", 26.784], ["energy", 27.237], ["output.", 27.724]], "raw": [{"text": "In", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.128}, {"text": "practical", "start": 0.197, "end": 0.685}, {"text": "questions,", "start": 0.755, "end": 1.428}, {"text": "a", "start": 1.521, "end": 1.614}, {"text": "device", "start": 1.707, "end": 2.101}, {"text": "takes", "st